  "title": "无前",
  "storyCode": "EG-10",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_16-04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "35e4ef0c88a0b22ac8f80814905a153dedeb869b6bc7eb5a3d94ad79f6733c84",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>乌萨斯远北边界，荒野</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "我跑......不动......了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "就到，这里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "远处的声音",
      "text": "那边好像有人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "远处的声音",
      "text": "我去看看——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "远处的声音",
      "text": "......不，请让我去吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "远处的声音",
      "text": "我感觉到那只是一个受过许多苦痛的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "脱力，脱水，许久未曾进食......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你也是感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "咳、咳咳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的声音",
      "text": "同胞，他也是我们的同胞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的声音",
      "text": "请您救救他吧，就像您救我们所有人一样——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的声音",
      "text": "再一次施行您的神迹！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那不是神迹......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "矿石病不是使他如此痛苦的主要原因，我只能使他不再因疾病而疼痛，却不能使他饱腹、给他干净的水喝、让他有安全的地方入睡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我无法施行神迹，我并非全能，我只是......相信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虔诚的声音",
      "text": "您总是这样谦逊，我们都明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......先生，您还能听见我说话吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "接下来，我会握住您的手......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“相信吧。相信我们的生命。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“相信我们的身体与思维，相信我们心脏的每一次律动，相信我们肺叶的每一次收放。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“相信我们自身，是一切力量的来源。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "从此，您不必再生活在对死亡的恐惧中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "源石在体内迅速生长带来的疼痛逐渐远去。\n他仍能听见那些声音，却不再因此疼得辗转反侧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "你——你是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "你救了我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "咳、咳咳，咳——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "我该怎么，感谢你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "您可以像这里所有的兄弟姊妹一样，称呼我为“希尔达”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的声音",
      "text": "神迹——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的声音",
      "text": "希尔达再一次救了我们的同胞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的声音",
      "text": "她救了我们所有人，只是用母亲一样的抚摸，就像刚才一样，抹去了所有的病痛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的声音",
      "text": "希尔达！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虔诚的声音",
      "text": "希尔达。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "许多人的声音",
      "text": "希尔达！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "希尔达......希尔达。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "text": "是的，那是我的名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "你长什么模样？无论是你，还是其他说话的人，我都看不清......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "text": "您的头上有伤，是跑得太急，在哪里跌了一跤，将头都撞破了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "text": "也许是脑中的淤血让您看不清。没关系，我们可以搀扶着您......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "text": "告诉我，您接下来要去哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者矿工",
      "text": "我不知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "text": "那就先同我们一起吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虔诚的声音",
      "text": "您要带我们去一个没有痛苦的地方，对不对？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "text": "是的，只要你们仍愿意与我同行......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "text": "只要我们相信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
